{"version":1,"content":"<p>Grok在讓人破繃這件事上，從來不會讓人失望。就在剛剛，安全公司Claroc發現，<strong>超過3.5萬個用Grok構建的應用，無需登錄就能訪問，其中一部分直接暴露了企業機密和個人私隱。</strong>最扎眼的是，老馬自家的SpaceXSI（SpaceX與xAI合併後的公司）和X，也在其中。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586060.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:44:30.451451+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:27:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:37:52.497420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:37:52.497420+00:00","content_hash":"80b126c780568bed1031bcfcb6743e614e24bf9fcf58404f7986652082ba570f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}